{"ticker":"LUV","updated":"2026-11-27T23:06:10Z","profile":{"longName":"Southwest Airlines Co.","shortName":"Southwest Airlines Company","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Airlines","country":"United States","website":"https://www.southwest.com","fullTimeEmployees":73092,"marketCap":23114127360,"trailingPE":23.029268,"forwardPE":11.058484,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.73271185,"pegRatio":1.64,"targetMeanPrice":50.22083,"targetHighPrice":65.0,"targetLowPrice":34.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":24,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.212,"earningsGrowth":4.5,"grossMargins":0.22142,"operatingMargins":0.04546,"profitMargins":0.03338,"totalRevenue":31545999360,"beta":1.219,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":55.11,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":34.28,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.57},"summary":"Southwest Airlines Co. operates as a passenger airline company that provides scheduled air transportation services in the United States and internationally. It also provides Rapid Rewards loyalty program; SWABIZ, an online booking tool; and inflight entertainment platform that includes movies-on-demand live and on-demand television, flight tracker, and additional curated content, as well as a variety of premium snacks and coffee. In addition, the company offers ancillary services, such as in-flight purchases, baggage fees, EarlyBird Check-In, and upgraded boarding, as well as transportation of pets and unaccompanied minors. As of December 31, 2025, the company operated a total fleet of 803 Boeing 737 aircraft; and served 117 destinations in 42 states, the District of Columbia, and the Commonwealth of Puerto Rico, as well as ten near-international countries, including Mexico, Jamaica, the Bahamas, Aruba, the Dominican Republic, Costa Rica, Belize, Cuba, the Cayman Islands, and Turks and Caicos. Southwest Airlines Co. was incorporated in 1967 and is headquartered in Dallas, Texas.","summary_zh":"西南航空是一家客運航空公司，在美國和國際上提供定期航空運輸服務。它還提供快速獎勵忠誠度計劃； SWABIZ，線上預訂工具；機上娛樂平台，包括電影點播直播和點播電視、航班追蹤器和其他精選內容，以及各種優質小吃和咖啡。此外，該公司還提供機上購買、行李費、早鳥報到、升級登機等輔助服務，以及寵物和無人陪伴的未成年人的運輸。截至2025年12月31日，該公司營運的機隊總數為803架波音737飛機；飛往 42 個州、哥倫比亞特區、波多黎各聯邦以及墨西哥、牙買加、巴哈馬、阿魯巴、多明尼加共和國、哥斯大黎加、伯利茲、古巴、開曼群島、特克斯和凱科斯群島等 10 個國際目的地的近17 個國際目的地。西南航空公司成立於 1967 年，總部位於德克薩斯州達拉斯。","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"航空","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-29","o":32.76,"h":33.06,"l":32.41,"c":32.76,"v":9139200},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":32.83,"h":32.89,"l":30.77,"c":31.91,"v":10283400},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":31.99,"h":32.55,"l":31.81,"c":32.28,"v":8546700},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":32.28,"h":32.58,"l":31.84,"c":32.31,"v":7438900},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":32.75,"h":33.49,"l":32.51,"c":32.52,"v":9214100},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":32.54,"h":32.71,"l":31.77,"c":32.58,"v":6908500},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":32.57,"h":32.76,"l":32.09,"c":32.39,"v":8065900},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":32.66,"h":32.7,"l":32.11,"c":32.45,"v":7688800},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":33.53,"h":33.73,"l":31.47,"c":31.68,"v":10590300},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":31.85,"h":32.63,"l":31.06,"c":31.29,"v":7987400},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":31.73,"h":32.32,"l":31.56,"c":31.9,"v":4892700},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":31.52,"h":33.63,"l":31.42,"c":33.42,"v":11028900},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":33.75,"h":33.88,"l":33.25,"c":33.56,"v":7429100},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":33.67,"h":34.05,"l":32.84,"c":33.29,"v":11017200},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":33.23,"h":33.8,"l":33.19,"c":33.52,"v":8264400},{"t":"2025-10-20","o":33.78,"h":34.67,"l":33.6,"c":34.43,"v":7636000},{"t":"2025-10-21","o":34.12,"h":34.98,"l":34.06,"c":34.68,"v":9405000},{"t":"2025-10-22","o":34.36,"h":34.75,"l":33.43,"c":33.76,"v":10576400},{"t":"2025-10-23","o":32.82,"h":33.15,"l":31.02,"c":31.65,"v":27807800},{"t":"2025-10-24","o":32.05,"h":32.43,"l":31.38,"c":32.2,"v":15189600},{"t":"2025-10-27","o":32.46,"h":32.74,"l":31.87,"c":32.25,"v":9621300},{"t":"2025-10-28","o":32.15,"h":32.18,"l":31.03,"c":31.09,"v":11384700},{"t":"2025-10-29","o":31.02,"h":31.13,"l":30.46,"c":30.66,"v":10919900},{"t":"2025-10-30","o":30.49,"h":30.77,"l":30.05,"c":30.09,"v